I see your folder listed in your phone's root storage directory as ubuntubitget!
To transfer that entire folder and everything inside it directly into your Ubuntu machine's ~/bidget directory, run this command:

adb pull /sdcard/ubuntubitget/ ~/bidget

## What this does:

* /sdcard/ubuntubitget/ points to the source folder we located on your phone.
* ~/bidget targets your existing folder on your Ubuntu computer as the destination.

